* Graphcore Firewall::          Why it includes neither lisp.h nor libregnum.h.
* Graphcore Data Model::        Nodes, edges and identity.
* Graphcore Force Layout::      The stepped solver, and its choices.
* Graphcore Placement::         Circle, hex and rings.
* Graphcore Tweening::          Animating a transition.
